import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 760 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Alaya Audit of Rule Self-Consistency","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 760 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Alaya Audit of Rule Self-Consistency","no":760,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules","Self-Consistency Audit","Alaya Network","Multi-Layer Supervision","Law Network"],"related":["21-Symbiotic-Network Operating Principle","97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0760_模块4-超多元级规则-自洽性阿赖耶审计.md","filePath":"en/0760_模块4-超多元级规则-自洽性阿赖耶审计.md"}'),n={name:"en/0760_模块4-超多元级规则-自洽性阿赖耶审计.md"};function o(s,e,l,u,d,c){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-760-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-alaya-audit-of-rule-self-consistency" tabindex="-1">Entry 760 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Alaya Audit of Rule Self-Consistency <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-760-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-alaya-audit-of-rule-self-consistency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 760 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | Alaya Audit of Rule Self-Consistency&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 97, 49</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-no-matter-how-good-the-rules-without-audit-they-slowly-rot" tabindex="-1">Introduction: no matter how good the rules, without audit they slowly rot <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-no-matter-how-good-the-rules-without-audit-they-slowly-rot" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: no matter how good the rules, without audit they slowly rot&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom requires rules be self-consistent, but self-consistency is not once-and-for-all. As the law network infinitely scales, continuously revises, and cross-plane transplants, it may at any moment produce new contradictions, new holes, new inconsistencies. This requires a continuously running audit system — not audited once a year, but real-time audited, network-wide audited, automatically audited. This is the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s core function in the rules domain.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are audit&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires audit identify predatory residue; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires audit identify discriminatory clauses; the collective ascension axiom requires audit identify hang-up clauses; the causal self-discipline axiom requires audit identify causal holes; the law-first axiom itself is audit&#39;s highest standard.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-audit-s-four-tiers" tabindex="-1">I. Audit&#39;s Four Tiers <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-audit-s-four-tiers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Audit&#39;s Four Tiers&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Alaya Network&#39;s rule-self-consistency audit is divided into four tiers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Frequency</th><th>Audit Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Real-Time Scan</td><td>Every second</td><td>Anomalous fluctuations and conflicts in law operation</td></tr><tr><td>Daily Report</td><td>Daily</td><td>Initial self-consistency screening of that day&#39;s newly added and revised laws</td></tr><tr><td>Quarterly Audit</td><td>Quarterly</td><td>Full law-network self-consistency scan</td></tr><tr><td>Annual Review</td><td>Annual</td><td>Deep audit + Myriad-Rank representatives participating in review</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The four tiers, from real-time to annual, ensure problems are discovered and handled early.</p><h2 id="ii-real-time-scan-the-alaya-network-s-automatic-patrol" tabindex="-1">II. Real-Time Scan: the Alaya Network&#39;s Automatic Patrol <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-real-time-scan-the-alaya-network-s-automatic-patrol" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Real-Time Scan: the Alaya Network&#39;s Automatic Patrol&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Alaya Network is a distributed law-monitoring system. Its real-time scan functions include:</p><ul><li><strong>Law-conflict detection</strong>: whether two laws produce contradictions in some concrete scenario;</li><li><strong>Energy-anomaly detection</strong>: whether there is anomalous energy flow during law operation (possibly predatory behavior);</li><li><strong>Drift detection</strong>: whether some law&#39;s actual effect has deviated from its designed definition;</li><li><strong>Coverage-blind-spot detection</strong>: whether some behaviors, some races, some scenarios are outside law coverage.</li></ul><p>Problems found by real-time scan auto-generate audit work orders, dispatched to relevant handling teams.</p><h2 id="iii-quarterly-full-audit" tabindex="-1">III. Quarterly Full Audit <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-quarterly-full-audit" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Quarterly Full Audit&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The quarterly full audit is jointly executed by the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision:</p><ol><li><strong>Full law list</strong>: pull all currently effective laws, classify by tier;</li><li><strong>Cross-comparison</strong>: compare pairwise, checking for contradictions;</li><li><strong>Version tracing</strong>: trace each law&#39;s historical revisions, checking for historical leftover contradictions;</li><li><strong>Simulated operation</strong>: simulate all laws running simultaneously in virtual space, checking for conflicts;</li><li><strong>Generate audit report</strong>: list all discovered problems, sorted by severity.</li></ol><p>The audit report is publicized network-wide, subject to Myriad-Rank supervision.</p><h2 id="iv-annual-review-myriad-ranks-participate" tabindex="-1">IV. Annual Review: Myriad Ranks Participate <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-annual-review-myriad-ranks-participate" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Annual Review: Myriad Ranks Participate&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The annual review is deeper than quarterly audit, and has Myriad-Rank representatives participating:</p><ul><li>The Alaya Network submits the annual audit master report;</li><li>The Myriad-Rank Representatives&#39; Assembly reviews by domain (cultivation, resources, medical care, education, etc.);</li><li>Each discovered problem&#39;s solution is discussed;</li><li>Major problems trigger entry 758&#39;s law-revision process;</li><li>Review results are publicized network-wide.</li></ul><p>The annual review is not only technical audit, but also Myriad Ranks&#39; collective confirmation of the law network.</p><h2 id="v-application-of-audit-results" tabindex="-1">V. Application of Audit Results <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-application-of-audit-results" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Application of Audit Results&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Audit is not for picking faults, but for improvement:</p><ul><li><strong>Minor problems</strong>: auto-fix or minor repair;</li><li><strong>Moderate problems</strong>: trigger formal revision process;</li><li><strong>Severe problems</strong>: suspend related laws&#39; execution, trigger emergency revision;</li><li><strong>Systemic problems</strong>: trigger the law network&#39;s architecture-level review.</li></ul><p>Audit results are simultaneously counted into the Anchor Council&#39;s legislative reference, helping legislators understand the law network&#39;s weak links.</p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: inconsistent laws cause execution chaos, repeated enforcement, and mutual contradiction, wasting large amounts of computable power; audit ensures the law network is clean and efficient</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: audit specifically scans whether some law protects predatory behavior, whether some hole is exploited by predatory factions</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s &quot;audit&quot; is Gu Chensha alone looking; Heng Yuan Zhou is Alaya Network automatic + Myriad-Rank representatives participating</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: audit reports are publicized network-wide; Myriad-Rank representatives participate in annual review; every race may influence law improvement</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: audit methods, audit standards, and audit reports are all public network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Alaya audit of rule self-consistency is the law network&#39;s &quot;immune system.&quot; It does not passively wait for rules to have problems then fix them, but actively, continuously scans, detects, and repairs. With this immune system, Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law network may always stay self-consistent through infinite scaling — it will not eat its own books, will not end in ruin, will not become civilizational shackles through aging.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic-Network Operating Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">Entry 97 · Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">Entry 49 · Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/27-锚点校准与维护.html">Entry 27 · Anchor Calibration and Maintenance</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const y=t(n,[["render",o]]);export{p as __pageData,y as default};
